<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of French League Cup second</p>
<p>round (last 16) matches on Sunday:</p>
<p> Strasbourg		  2   Cannes		 0</p>
<p> Le Mans (II)		1   Monaco		 3</p>
<p> Caen			  1   Metz		   0</p>
<p> Louhans-Cuiseaux (II)   0   Nantes		 0</p>
<p>(after extra time, Louhans win 4-2 on penalties)</p>
<p>Rennes v Lyon postponed, playing on Wednesday</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p> Nimes (III)  0  Montpellier   1</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p> Bordeaux     1  Marseille     0 (after extra time)</p>
<p> Toulon (II)  0  Lens	    1</p>
</text>
